This is the Joomla! installation package containing
both the bfstop plugin as well as the com_bfstop
component. Both are needed for a fully operational
installation of the Brute Force Stop functionality!

This repository only contains the installation files;
for more information, see the bfstop extension wiki:
https://github.com/codeling/bfstop/wiki

Any problems should be reported in the common issue
tracker of the bfstop extension, located here:
https://github.com/codeling/bfstop/issues

Requirements: BFStop 2 needs Joomla! 5 or 6 and PHP 8.1 or newer; the
package refuses to install on anything older (sites on Joomla! 4 stay with
BFStop 1.5).

Building a release: check out the release's tag of the plugin
(codeling/bfstop) and the component (codeling/com_bfstop), then

    ./deploy.sh <plugin checkout> <component checkout>

builds both extension zips into packages/ and the package zip from them. It
refuses to build a package whose packages/ hold another version than the
package's, so a release can't ship the extensions of an earlier one.
